    "dayOfWeek 使用 1-7 表示周一到周日；weeks 和 duration 支持 1-16、1,3,5 这类写法。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "dayOfWeek uses 1-7 to represent Monday to Sunday; weeks and duration support formats like 1-16, 1,3,5."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "term 可写学期，credit 和 score 按学校原表填写；type 可写必修、选修、通识等分类。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "term can write the semester, credit and score should be filled in according to the school's original table; type can write compulsory, elective, general education, etc."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "·": {
