    "这会删除所有医疗台账和本地照片，无法恢复。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This will delete all medical records and local photos and cannot be undone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这会撤销所有同学的查看权限，并让已生成的邀请码立即失效。已发布的课表仍只对你自己可见。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This will revoke all classmates' viewing permissions and immediately invalidate any generated invitation codes. Published schedules will still only be visible to you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这会永久删除社区资料、帖子、评论、互动和私有媒体，并清除当前设备上的课表、成绩、草稿、学习资料和其他 MyLeafy 数据。此操作不会删除或修改北京林业大学官方教务账户。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This will permanently delete community profiles, posts, comments, interactions, and private media, and clear schedules, grades, drafts, study materials, and other MyLeafy data on the current device. This operation will not delete or modify the official academic account of Beijing Forestry University."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这条随记会移到回收站，你可以稍后恢复。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This journal entry will be moved to the recycle bin, and you can restore it later."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "进入社区前请确认已阅读并同意 %arg 社区条款。社区对违规内容和滥用用户零容忍。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Please confirm that you have read and agreed to the %arg community terms before entering the community. The community has zero tolerance for illegal content and user abuse."
          }
        }
      }
    },
