    " 其他统计按有效课程计算：同名同学分课程会合并，补考或重修优先取已通过且分数最高记录；优秀、良好、中等等明确等级会映射为可解释的分值，通过制成绩只计通过与学分，不计入分数统计。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Other statistics are calculated based on valid courses: courses with the same name and student will be merged; for makeup or retake exams, the passed record with the highest score is prioritized; grades like excellent, good, medium, etc., will be mapped to interpretable scores; pass/fail system only counts pass and credits, not for score statistics."
